  "notes": "JAPANESE CULTURE:\n{初|はつ}{日|ひ}の{出|で} (first sunrise of the new year) is traditionally considered auspicious in Japan. Many people travel to mountains, beaches, or temples to watch the first sunrise on January 1st.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {日|ひ}の{入|い}り / {日没|にちぼつ} (sunset)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {夜明|よあ}け / {明|あ}け{方|がた} (dawn - before sunrise)\n- {朝日|あさひ} (morning sun)\n- {日|ひ}の{光|ひかり} (sunlight)",
